"description": "EPR Properties operates as a real estate investment trust. It engages in the development, financing, and leasing of theaters, entertainment retail centers, and family entertainment centers. The firm operates through the following segments: Experiential and Education. The Experiential segment includes investments in megaplex theaters, entertainment retail centers, family entertainment centers, and other retail properties. The Education segment consists of investments in public charter schools. The company was founded by Peter C. Brown on August 22, 1997 and is headquartered in Kansas City, MO.",
